# OS
.DS_Store

# Project artefacts
# The generated corpus (3 MB) stays out; the SEED corpus does not. Without
# it, `reproduce_ablation.sh` step 1 fails on a fresh clone and nothing in
# the repository can regenerate or falsify the numbers in
# ABLATION_RESULTS.md. seed_corpus.txt + generate_synthetic.py +
# split_corpus.py reproduce data/ deterministically.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
!data/seed_corpus.txt
checkpoints/*
!checkpoints/.gitkeep
# runs/*.json ARE the evidence behind every number in ABLATION_RESULTS.md
# and are checked by scripts/verify_ablation.py --check. They are 4 KB in
# total and must travel with the repo; only the bulky logs are ignored.
runs/*
!runs/*.json
wandb/
*.log
